			shape: "rsquare"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5C7476AF066BA1E3"
				title: "开始你的旅途吧！"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Start Your Journey"
			x: 7.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2EBB4C697D81D42A"]
			description: [
				"In normal dungeon exploration, you may occasionally obtain a special trinket known as the &6Uncharged Divine Grace Necklace&r. While carrying it, defeating a &2boss with high destructive power and strong regeneration&r will fully charge it."
				""
				"At the same time, in the special desert-themed instance of the Dimensional Dungeon, you can find a summoning altar built upon command blocks. By using this altar and consuming a Charged Divine Grace Necklace as the summoning catalyst, you can randomly summon a &cDivine Grace Boss&r."
				""
				"The &cDivine Grace Boss&r is not inherently extremely powerful, as its abilities are similar to the original boss. However, it places a relatively high demand on player DPS. Throughout all phases, it has a constant regeneration rate of &61% of max health per second&r, and &2at every 33% health threshold, it randomly gains a type of damage immunity&r. In the final 33% of its health, it will also &2enter a 180-second DPS check&r. If it is not defeated before the buff expires, it will &4fully restore its health&r and gain an additional immunity type."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To successfully defeat the Divine Grace Boss, you will need effective means of attack in all three types: &2magic, ranged, and melee&r."
				""
				"After defeating the Divine Grace Boss, you will obtain a Divine Fragment corresponding to its soul type, which can be used in the crafting of the legendary organ &b“Eden Reborn”&r."
			]
			icon: "dimdungeons:item_blank_theme_key"
			id: "5EB8592EEE08BF45"
			rewards: [{
				id: "170703F1786429BB"
				item: {
					Count: 1b
					id: "dimdungeons:item_blank_theme_key"
					tag: {
						theme: 2
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "An &4EXTREMELY&r dangerous summoning ritual"
			tasks: [{
				id: "27FEE67CC6FF3B6C"
				item: "kubejs:god_bless_empty_necklace"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Divine Ritual"
			x: 7.0d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EB8592EEE08BF45"]
			description: ["Defeat three different &6Divine Grace Bosses&r and use three &4Divine Fragment&r types from different souls to obtain &6Eden Reborn&r."]
