		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0DCDFAD4C3288FCD"]
			description: [
				"Besides the Trial of Divine Will, there are also other Challenge Gate contents such as &6Elemental Carnival&r and &6Boss Rush&r."
				""
				"Among them, the most difficult is the &9Final Onslaught&r, which consists of 17 waves of raid-related enemies, culminating in the final boss,the &cBlade Emperor&r."
			]
