		}
		{
			dependencies: ["03B3A54BEDB85320"]
			description: [
				"By crafting a Personal Dimension Key, &2you can access your own pocket dimension&r. In this dimension, you can edit the allowed player list for your portals using various items."
				""
				"Hold the following items and &eright-click a portal block inside the pocket dimension&r to trigger their effects:"
				""
				"&6Book&r: View the current visitor list"
				"&6White Dye&r: Switch to whitelist mode"
				"&6Black Dye&r: Switch to blacklist mode"
				"&6Paper&r: Rename it via an anvil to a player’s name, then use it to add that player to the visitor list"
				"&6Grindstone&r: Clear the current visitor list"
				""
				"Private dimensions are often used to store personal items or simply as a superflat space for building."
			]
			id: "5255A65B18FE588A"
			rewards: [{
				id: "474C5603581AF6D5"
				item: {
					Count: 1b
					id: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
					tag: { }
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "A pocket dimension"
			tasks: [{
				id: "53C3F084DD6F041A"
				item: "dimdungeons:item_blank_build_key"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Personal Dimension"
			x: 3.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["03B3A54BEDB85320"]
			description: [
				"To better explore dungeons, you can use two special items: the Bell of Secret and the Homeward Pearl."
				""
				"The &6Bell of Secret&r can be used to detect whether a room contains hidden chests. If any are present, it will emit a sequence of 8 musical notes. &7(The Secret Bell can be obtained from special chests in Dimensional Dungeons, which are often found in rooms with traps and puzzles.)&r"
				""
				"The &6Homeward Pearl&r allows you to quickly return back to the dungeon entrance."
			]
			icon: "dimdungeons:item_secret_bell"
			id: "738F8D1CEDC020F1"
			rewards: [{
				id: "65B0A76807157940"
				item: {
					Count: 1b
					id: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
					tag: { }
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Become the Master of Dungeons"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "33343BF20AC4B52E"
