			title: "Dungeon Explorer"
			x: 4.75d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["03B3A54BEDB85320"]
			description: [
				"In the loot chests of basic dungeons, you may occasionally find an item known as the &2Advanced Portal Key&r."
				""
				"The Advanced Portal Key can be used to activate an &6Advanced Portal&r, granting access to higher tier dungeon. Inside these advanced dungeons, chest loot is significantly better, and you may even encounter enchanted books that exceed normal enchantment level limits!"
				""
				"To activate the key, you must construct an &dAdvanced Portal&r. This is done by placing &6Dimensional Crown Blocks&r on both sides of the &6Portal Keystone&r, and &2hanging white or purple banners on the tops of the two side pillars&r. &7(As shown below; Dimensional Crown Seats are obtained from dungeon chests.)&r"
				"{image:kubejs:textures/task/dimensiona_3.png width:160 height:80 align:1}"
			]
			icon: "dimdungeons:block_portal_crown"
			id: "45AB5B1831B0AACF"
			rewards: [{
				id: "005036E6044961EE"
				item: {
					Count: 1b
					id: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
					tag: { }
