		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4452DA9A1D3D80A0"]
			description: [
				"You can craft your own Key Inscribing Table following its recipe. It functions similarly to an End Portal activation mechanism, allowing you to activate portal keys at home."
				""
				"&7(Selenite Cluster generates in Selenite geodes found underground in jungles and swamps.)&r"
