		{
			dependencies: ["45AB5B1831B0AACF"]
			description: [
				"If you obtain a &6Portal Hall Key&r, you can access a highly unique dungeon through a portal. This dungeon contains no monsters at all, but instead consists of a &2hall filled with multiple portals&r."
				""
				"Inside, you can collect the corresponding portal keys at different portal locations. You can then return to the world and set up dimensional portals at various locations, inserting the matching keys into them. In this way, different portals can all lead to the same portal hall."
				""
				"This effectively allows you to build a multi-dimensional, multi-location &6transit hub&r!"
			]
			id: "055755574AC4697C"
