		{
			dependencies: ["15A36D9385499A77"]
			description: [
				"Soon, exploring the Overworld will no longer satisfy all your needs—nearby structures will have already been fully looted, while distant regions are simply too inconvenient to reach."
				""
				"At this point, you can craft the &6Dimensional Dungeon Gate&r at home and venture into the dungeons for exploration! The difficulty of Dimensional Dungeon exploration is relatively low, but each area offers its own unique charm. In addition, its reward chests often contain more useful items than those found in the Overworld！"
