			dependencies: ["2311CA3EEABF0250"]
			description: ["When you enter The End, your vanilla Minecraft experience comes to a close, but for this modpack, reaching The End is only a small milestone. There are still countless &5incredible wonders&r in this world waiting for you to explore."]
