		{
			dependencies: ["6FB9DA46381FBCB6"]
			description: [
				"You will need to play through the &dHexerei&r mod in order to craft one of the modpack’s more &eessential&r items—the &6Summoning Altar&r. &7(The creation of the Summoning Altar also requires some components from Create.)&r"
				""
				"&r&2—The Summoning Altar can be used to craft various items and organs, as well as to summon all 21 bosses from the someBosses mod.&r"
				""
				"In general, since some later recipes depend on the Hexerei's &6Mixing Cauldron&r, we recommend prioritizing progression in this mod."
				""
				"The Hexerei progression path is &eshort&r and mainly serves to enhance immersion with some &eoptional content&r, so there is no need to worry about heavy progression requirements. In fact, Hexerei can also provide useful conveniences for your exploration journey. &7(Who wouldn’t love a flying broom?)&r"
				""
				"Place the &dBook of Shadows&r on a altar, and begin your journey of discovery."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1b
				id: "hexerei:book_of_shadows"
				tag: {
					bookmarks: { }
					chapter: 0
					opened: 0b
					page: 0
				}
			}
			id: "00E3E147FC750C90"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "69A47379C6E0551E"
					item: {
						Count: 1b
						id: "hexerei:book_of_shadows"
						tag: {
							bookmarks: { }
							chapter: 0
							opened: 0b
							page: 0
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "0AB96012391DCB55"
					item: "hexerei:book_of_shadows_altar"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			shape: "circle"
			subtitle: "Sorcery? Magic? Or Science?"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3342C5E8A28DC165"
				title: "探寻魔法的秘密"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Uncover the Secrets of Magic"
			x: 5.75d
			y: 10.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["00E3E147FC750C90"]
			description: [
				"Although this modpack provides guidance for the &dHexerei&r mod, we still strongly encourage you to read its &ce&bxtre&dmely&ecool&r guidebook, the Book of Shadows."
				""
				"Now, we need to craft a &6Mixing Cauldron&r, which serves as the crafting station for Hexerei."
				""
				"Once again, for unfamiliar “workstation” recipes, it is recommended to &ehover your mouse over the item&r, press &eU (Show Uses)&r, and then switch to the recipe view at the top of the interface. This allows you to &2clearly see all craftable items and their recipes&r. &7(As shown below.)&r"
				""
				"&r{image:kubejs:textures/task/hexerei_1.png width:120 height:100 align:1}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Some tips:"
				""
				"1. Although the Mixing Cauldron has an interaction interface, adding water requires you to &2pour it directly in&r using a water bucket."
				""
				"2. Some recipes require a &6heat source block&r placed &ebelow&r the cauldron. Recommended heat sources include &ecampfires&r or &emagma block&r. You can find more heat sources in the previous page under &2“Show Uses”&r."
				""
				"3. You can place items into the cauldron through its interface, or simply stand beside it and &2throw items directly into it&r."
			]
			id: "5B62D052AA6FF2D3"
			rewards: [{
				id: "077E1F89F281FD85"
				item: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Witch's Treasure"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5343118C1A6F92EB"
				item: "hexerei:mixing_cauldron"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 4.25d
			y: 10.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B62D052AA6FF2D3"]
			description: [
				"Another important feature of &dHexerei&r is the magical broom system. There are different types such as the &6Willow Broom&r and the &6Mahogany Broom&r, allowing you to easily travel and explore various locations."
				""
				"Brooms &2can be decorated and upgraded using items such as satchels, trinkets, and other accessories&r, giving them strong &6DIY potential&r."
				""
				"However, in terms of practicality, if you find Hexerei’s broom system too cumbersome, you may instead craft the &6Witch’s Broom&r. &7(You can find its recipe via JEI.)&r"
				""
				"&7Mahogany trees generate in jungles, while willow trees generate in swamps. For other basic resources from this mod, it is recommended to refer to the “Structures” section in the Book of Shadows and search within structures.&r"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1b
				id: "hexerei:mahogany_broom"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "7AAEA01D27277498"
			rewards: [{
