		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5DD1124BDBF1D5EC"]
			description: [
				"First, you need to obtain animal fat by killing cows, pigs, or sheep."
				""
				"Once you have collected 8 pieces of animal fat, place them into a Mixing Cauldron filled with water to produce tallow."
				""
				"Hold the &6Dipper&r and sneak-right-click the Mixing Cauldron to place it on top. Make sure the cauldron contains tallow, then use string on the Dipper (right-click while holding string) to begin dipping candles."
				""
				"A single Dipper can process up to three candles at the same time."
				""
				"&7If the cauldron contains a potion instead of tallow, the dipped candles will gain the corresponding potion effect. Once lit, the candles will grant that effect within a certain area.&r"
			]
			id: "17612117FFCB6D00"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "606BAC53708BAC2B"
				item: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
