				item: "hexerei:candle"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Preparing for the Summoning Altar"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 8.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["17612117FFCB6D00"]
			description: [
				"The guidance for &dHexerei&r ends here after crafting the essential “Candles” required for the main progression. The mod will not be mandatory for further gameplay."
				""
				"However, Hexerei offers much more content beyond this point. You can explore all of its items by typing &d“&n@Hexerei&r”&r in the JEI search bar to better experience the mod."
				""
				"In addition, the mod’s guidebook, the Book of Shadows has provides detailed explanations of its mechanics and is also recommended reading to help you further understand and enjoy the mod."
			]
			icon: {
