			description: [
				"&7The Summoning Altar not only requires support from the &dHexerei&r mod, but also a bit of &bCreate&r&7 content. Since Create has quite a lot of content, please refer to the FTB Create section for details.&r"
				""
				"The Summoning Altar is mainly used for summoning entities, but that does not mean it is limited to that. In fact, it can also be used for &6special recipes&r, granting various &2items&r or even &2effect-based&r rewards."
				""
				"Summoning rituals will be used frequently throughout your journey. If you are planning to &2locate and defeat specific bosses&r, it may be worth checking the altar recipes, you might discover an easier way."
